MANUAL_ONLY=true
TITLE=E2E-71: MCP — API key scope enforcement and revocation
TAGS=mcp,auth
MODE=mcp
BODY=Create API keys in Settings → API keys as an admin (non-admin POST must 403), confirm the raw mw_sk_ value is shown exactly once, that label/scope validation rejects empty and oversized input, that a repo-scoped key calling review_diff for another repo returns -32001, that missing/malformed Authorization returns -32001, that revocation takes effect on the very next request, and that lastUsedAt advances. No fixture PR.
